    "body_text": "Skip Navigation\n \n\n+ Advanced Search\n\nHelp Text Size: -A +A\nSan Carlos Municipal Code\n  Contents\n\nClick the plus (+) or minus (-) symbols to expand or collapse the entries. Click the checkboxes to select sections for saving or printing.\n\nRevised marks sections affected by recently codified ordinances.\n\nClear all\n\n+ Title 1 GENERAL PROVISIONS\n\n+ Title 2 ADMINISTRATION AND PERSONNEL\n\n+ Title 3 REVENUE AND FINANCE\n\n–  Title 4 (RESERVED)\n\n+ Title 5 BUSINESS TAXES, LICENSES AND REGULATIONS\n\n+ Title 6 ANIMALS\n\n–  Title 7 (RESERVED)\n\n+ Title 8 HEALTH AND SAFETY\n\n+ Title 9 PUBLIC PEACE AND WELFARE\n\n+ Title 10 VEHICLES AND TRAFFIC\n\n–  Title 11 (RESERVED)\n\n+ Title 12 STREETS, SIDEWALKS AND PUBLIC PLACES\n\n+ Title 13 PUBLIC SERVICES\n\n–  Title 14 (RESERVED)\n\n+ Title 15 BUILDINGS AND CONSTRUCTION\n\n–  Title 16 (RESERVED)\n\n+ Title 17 SUBDIVISIONS\n\n+ Title 18 ZONING Revised 7/26\n\n+ STATUTORY REFERENCES FOR CALIFORNIA CITIES\n\n–  ORDINANCE TABLE\n\nCode Version:\nCurrent\nJan 2026\nJan 2025\nJan 2024\nJan 2023\nJan 2022\nJan 2021\nJan 2020\nJan 2019\nJan 2018\nJan 2017\nJan 2016\nJan 2015\nJan 2014\nJan 2013\nJan 2012\nJan 2011\nJan 2010\nJan 2009\nJan 2008\nFeb 2007\nCompare this\npage with:\nJan 2026\nJan 2025\nJan 2024\nJan 2023\nJan 2022\nJan 2021\nJan 2020\nJan 2019\nJan 2018\nJan 2017\nJan 2016\nJan 2015\nJan 2014\nJan 2013\nJan 2012\nJan 2011\nJan 2010\nJan 2009\nJan 2008\nCurrent Version\nTitle 1 GENERAL PROVISIONS\n  \nTitle 1\nGENERAL PROVISIONS\n\nChapters:\n\n1.01    Code Adoption\n\n1.04    General Provisions\n\n1.08    City Seal\n\n1.16    Arrest Procedure\n\n1.20    Penalties\n\n1.25    Appeals\n\n1.26    Procedure and Limitations Period for Filing Claims\n\n1.30    Developer Indemnification\n\n  \n\nThe San Carlos Municipal Code is current through Ordinance 1637, passed June 22, 2026.\n\nDisclaimer: The City Clerk's Office has the official version of the San Carlos Municipal Code. Users should contact the City Clerk's Office for ordinances passed subsequent to the ordinance cited above.\n\nCity Website: https://www.cityofsancarlos.org/\nCity Telephone: (650) 802-4222\n\nCodification services provided by General Code\n\nMobile Version",
